If you kiss the game

19
00:01:52,260 --> 00:02:02,020
Back to the capital.

20
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:09,780
Yes, I realize she's just returned, but I do have an official order.

21
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:13,240
Well, it appears to be legitimate.

22
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:17,760
There's no need to worry, ma'am. We'll take every precaution to get her there safely.

23
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:25,000
As soon as Marie comes home from battle, they summon her to the capital again.

24
00:02:25,740 --> 00:02:29,960
I can't imagine what the magic parliament could possibly want with a child her age.

25
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:31,420
Sister Teresa!

26
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:34,080
Is something wrong, Rebecca?

27
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:38,000
There's trouble. Look at this. It's today's paper.

28
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:42,940
Is this true? It can't be! No! Why?

29
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,600
Look what they said about Asta!

30
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,700
Ah! Oh!

31
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:48,840
Wait a minute!

32
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,720
Turning against the kingdom. Serving a devil?

33
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,020
Lies! Not one bit of it is true!

34
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:02,880
Looks like that snuck-nosed commoner showed his true colors.

35
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:04,340
He's such a loser!

36
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:09,500
Does that mean Asta will have to come and work here too?

37
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:12,600
This is so exciting, I can't wait to dissect him!

38
00:03:12,780 --> 00:03:14,440
He promised me I could!

39
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,060
Who cares?

40
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,500
Geez, why are you so angry?

41
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:19,940
I'm not angry!

42
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,180
Whoa, your blood is boiling!

43
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:25,740
I know! Maybe I should drain a few pints of it!

44
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:27,120
That'll fix you!

45
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:28,540
Hell no!

46
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,000
Wait a sec!

47
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,760
Why do I have to put up with all this nonsense anyway?

48
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:36,080
Hey, Valtos! What am I doing in this garbage heap?

49
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:40,500
Who knows? It's not my fault you decided to follow me.

50
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:43,540
I came here so I could atone for my sins.

51
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,100
You're so damn useless!

52
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:55,540
I'll cut you villains limb from limb if you don't get to work now!

53
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,480
We can't work if you keep on attacking!

54
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,020
You'll kill us!

55
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:00,220
Crazy cleave!

56
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,780
What do you think I care?

57
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:07,040
If I had my way, you'd been carved up like dinner hams as soon as I laid eyes on you!

58
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,960
Go on! Run away!

59
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:11,660
Give me an excuse to use my blades!

60
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,160
You call us villains?

61
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:15,060
You're the most violent one here!

62
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,800
When you die, I'll make your corpse into a puppet!

63
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:20,040
I'll bind you with my chains!

64
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:21,140
Shut up!

65
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:25,460
Asta!

66
00:04:26,220 --> 00:04:27,280
They're mad!

67
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,520
Asta didn't do anything wrong!

68
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:32,040
They can't make him take the blame for our crimes!

69
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:33,440
But they can, Klaus!

70
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:36,120
I mean, we're talking about Donatio here!

71
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,480
He's ruthless!

72
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,840
They say he's even judged his own father!

73
00:04:40,620 --> 00:04:43,660
He gives cruel punishments, and he never shows mercy!

74
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,060
No matter what!

75
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:48,080
They'll punish him and anyone attached to him!

76
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:50,000
This doesn't look good!

77
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,880
Let's hope they don't find Asta guilty!

78
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:56,780
He looks hideous!

79
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,760
Just like the legends!

80
00:04:59,140 --> 00:05:00,100
He's a devil!

81
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:07,400
You've finally shown us your true self, you monster!

82
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,580
I can change into my dark form quicker now!

83
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:14,740
After that last fight, I'm learning how to make it my own!

84
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,280
I'm so scared!

85
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,820
You'll be fine, Marie.

86
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,420
Promise.

87
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,620
I'm not gonna let them hurt you.

88
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:22,060
Okay.

89
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:24,740
Now everybody, listen up!

90
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,940
Don't panic!

91
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:29,300
I can control my power, so there's no need to be afraid!

92
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,900
I'm not dangerous!

93
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:33,340
Why should we believe what you say?

94
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,380
You're possessed!

95
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,860
I can't bear to look at him!

96
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,200
He's disgusting!

97
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:41,540
You're just a street urchin who made a deal with a devil!

98
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,860
Put him to death!

99
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:45,520
I knew the boy was trash all along!

100
00:05:46,060 --> 00:05:46,740
Devil?

101
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,820
Oh dear!

102
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:53,260
A treasonous commoner like him deserves nothing less than the death penalty!

103
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:54,500
Harsh!

104
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,920
Please just listen for a sec!

105
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,940
Kill him before he wreaks even more havoc on our kingdom!

106
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:02,620
What more evidence do you need?

107
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,300
Give up, boy.

108
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:15,260
Even if you managed to defeat me and escape this trial, you would only become a fugitive.

109
00:06:16,620 --> 00:06:18,580
There's nowhere for you to run.

110
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:24,580
And if you do flee, I'm afraid I can't assure the safety of the people in the church who raised you.

111
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:29,180
So the best option is for you to be convicted here and now.

112
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:32,160
You are a dangerous entity that needs to disappear.

113
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:36,720
And once you do, that little girl and the magic knights will be spared.

114
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:41,000
No one in this room nor in this whole kingdom can save you.

115
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,540
And none of them has any desire to.

116
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:49,180
You bring despair and calamity to everything you touch.

117
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,520
Which means you are evil.

118
00:06:54,580 --> 00:07:06,940
What's happening?

119
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:07,680
What?

120
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:08,420
Who's there?

121
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:14,460
I was told the trial would be held two days from now.

122
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:18,180
I should have known you clowns were going to try to play by your own rules.

123
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:23,240
Anyway, I came here to say I don't give a rat's ass if a kid's evil or not.

124
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:28,820
He might be younger than me, but I've decided that Asta's a real man's man, not to mention a total badass.

125
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:31,300
And he's a really good friend of mine.

126
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:34,640
So there's no way I'm going to stand here and let you convict him.

127
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:40,100
If you lay one finger on my best pal, you'll be cursed for all of eternity.

128
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:43,280
And I've transformed into Asta before!

129
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:46,640
I know how brave he is and I want to be like that someday!

130
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:51,860
Asta's a super good boy!

131
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,800
He's nice!

132
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:59,300
Marie would be sad if you died, so I guess I don't mind saving you along with her.

133
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,000
But you better take your hands off her!

134
00:08:02,380 --> 00:08:08,780
He may be a boy, but in my eyes he's a courageous young man who can make even the cruelest fates bounce right off him.

135
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:13,180
I couldn't ask for a better partner. In fact, he makes me look good just being his superior.

136
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:17,900
So many snacks he hasn't tried! It would be a crime if he died now!

137
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,120
He's a stupid little shrimp.

138
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:24,900
But I'm willing to admit, he's pretty close to what a magic knight is supposed to be.

139
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:26,580
I mean, kind of.

140
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,280
He's a loud, reckless, obnoxious idiot.

141
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:33,600
But as royalty, I have to admit he's a person the kingdom can't do without.

142
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,740
But it's not that I would really care one way or the other.

143
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:44,440
We're not leaving here without him.

144
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:46,320
Give Asta back!

145
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:53,200
Ah yes, the Black Bulls.

146
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,980
What's that strange vehicle of theirs?

147
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:57,680
They have no right to be here!

148
00:08:58,220 --> 00:09:01,320
How dare you disturb these honorable proceedings!

149
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,960
Yamisuki Hiro.

150
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:11,220
Am I to understand that you and your companions are defending the criminal who started this great war?

151
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:16,760
I trust you know what will happen to the Black Bulls as a result of your foolishness.

152
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,760
Obviously, you haven't heard of us.

153
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:23,580
We're basically the worst Magic Knight squad that ever existed.

154
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,140
And both of those brats with the horns are members.

155
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:29,820
Oh, me too?

156
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,800
You messed with our squad mates.

157
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,340
So call us Riff Raff, Rebels, whatever.

158
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:37,280
We're here to take back what's ours!

159
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,700
You guys came.

160
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:57,120
You may be innocent, but you're still going to be punished for touching Marie.

161
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,960
What now, brother?

162
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,380
Let him be!

163
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:06,140
I can't believe you were gullible enough to walk into a trap I warned you about!

164
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:09,440
What, are you too stupid to keep yourself alive for five minutes?

165
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:12,160
Obviously, he is.

166
00:10:12,180 --> 00:10:13,920
This is a great time for a duel!

167
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,100
The day you die is the day I die!

168
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:20,020
Put Marie down right now or I'll give you the death penalty myself!

169
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:22,980
I thought you guys were here to save me!

170
00:10:23,700 --> 00:10:25,000
Stop it, big brother!

171
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:30,140
That's an odd way of thanking someone for protecting your sister.

172
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:34,780
Thanks for locking up my squad members, you royal jackass.

173
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,540
Real nice justice you got there.

174
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,520
Please don't worry about me, sir!

175
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,040
Take Asta and get out of here!

176
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,760
I'm not from this era.

177
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:47,220
And because of the forbidden magic, I'm not even a human anymore.

178
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:50,480
Besides, I basically used you to complete my mission.

179
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:57,020
You've got some nerve saying all that stuff after I let you crash at our hideout for so long.

180
00:10:57,020 --> 00:11:02,320
You've been watching us forever, and somehow you still don't get it.

181
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:05,360
Oh yeah, I heard all about you.

182
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:09,040
So you were kicking ass as a little bird for 500 years?

183
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,660
How awesome is that?

184
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:13,420
And all by yourself.

185
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:17,900
You must have been so lonely, poor thing.

186
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:21,020
I definitely know what that feels like.

187
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:24,860
We can always use another beautiful young lady on the team.

188
00:11:24,860 --> 00:11:26,720
You worked hard in the shadows.

189
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:28,900
So we'd probably get along really well.

190
00:11:29,340 --> 00:11:31,140
I would ask if you and I could be friends.

191
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:35,160
Except, we've been best friends since the moment I was born.

192
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,120
Um, yes, please join us!

193
00:11:37,220 --> 00:11:38,980
You've seen all the fun we have together.

194
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:41,040
Now you can be a part of it too.

195
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:43,600
Just promise me you'll share your snacks!

196
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:46,680
Wow, it's a good thing I didn't need her back when she was a bird.

197
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:48,320
Tell me I didn't hear that.

198
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:53,260
Look, the Black Bulls are a wacky group of misfits.

199
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:57,980
So if you're worried about being too different for us, you must not have been paying attention.

200
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:01,400
Besides, I'm already familiar with your key.

201
00:12:02,540 --> 00:12:05,240
Trust me, one more weirdo isn't gonna hurt anything.

202
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:07,340
Are you sure?

203
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:22,060
Sealing magic.

204
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,080
Eternal prison.

205
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:31,300
In that case, I'll join you.

206
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,540
Sounds good.

207
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:35,980
Our squad's rep is as pitch black as it gets anyway.

208
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:37,720
That's us!

209
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,980
Like us or not, we are the Black Bulls!

210
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:53,600
It seems I haven't made myself clear.

211
00:12:55,020 --> 00:12:59,600
Even if you protect that devil's cohorts, it won't change the outcome at all.

212
00:13:00,700 --> 00:13:03,640
Causing a fuss here won't clear the criminal's name.

213
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:08,840
In fact, the charges against him for conspiring with a devil will become more severe.

214
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:13,580
Your impassioned pleas for your friend will do nothing to help the kingdom.

215
00:13:15,220 --> 00:13:17,960
These nobles will never change their minds.

216
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:21,440
They're swayed by bewilderment and suspicion.

217
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,520
And even if they did revolt...

218
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,780
Scale magic.

219
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,940
Scale regulating.

220
00:13:34,540 --> 00:13:36,520
Whoa! My poor sheep!

221
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:37,420
He's drinking!

222
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:39,800
My scale measures spells.

223
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:44,860
It judges your magic, balances it, and creates order.

224
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:49,180
No matter how powerful you are, you can't win.

225
00:13:50,040 --> 00:13:51,940
But Rouge hasn't disappeared.

226
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:55,500
Which means he won't be able to do anything to us.

227
00:13:56,380 --> 00:14:00,440
And we have someone on our side who can make the impossible possible.

228
00:14:02,060 --> 00:14:03,720
Demon destroyer sword!

229
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,060
Fate release!

230
00:14:05,060 --> 00:14:12,100
Did he just erase the effects of my magic?

231
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,440
Your move, Justice Boy.

232
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:16,500
Justice Boy.

233
00:14:16,500 --> 00:14:29,140
If it isn't the foreigner, you're as reckless as always, I see.

234
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:32,020
What exactly were you planning to do next?

235
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:35,240
Uh, I usually make things up as I go along.

236
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:37,740
It almost looked like you were trying to miss.

237
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:38,980
You brute.

238
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:43,860
But even if you did this to rescue your squad members, you still couldn't have made a worse impression.

239
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,260
Though it did by some time.

240
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:49,840
What is with the big lizard?

241
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:53,260
Wow, you really came back with a bang, didn't you, tough guy?

242
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:54,980
Now it's you guys?

243
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:57,440
So how many people are gonna bust in here?

244
00:14:57,440 --> 00:15:01,660
In light of recent events, we can't afford to lose any strong magic knights.

245
00:15:01,900 --> 00:15:07,480
Regardless of our difference in status, we still acknowledge you and your squad mates as valuable allies.

246
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:10,260
Now Zell is here, and Vrygoleon too.

247
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:13,260
Those magic knights are both royals.

248
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,620
Why are they here?

249
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:18,160
Is there something I can do for you?

250
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:22,700
We've been given a message from the Wizard King.

251
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,280
It's for the Black Bulls.

252
00:15:26,700 --> 00:15:27,720
A special mission.

253
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:31,100
You are to locate and investigate these devils.

254
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:37,040
You will prove your innocence with your own hands.

255
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:39,360
Oh, I get it.

256
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,520
Royals have the authority here.

257
